   115	
   116	        // Some Emojis in UTF-16 are stored as a pair of 2 Unicode characters (e.g. Flags)
   117	        // The first char is generally between the range U+D800 to U+DBFF called High surrogate
   118	        // & the second char between the range U+DC00 to U+DFFF called low surrogate
   119	        // More info in the following links:
